    "field": "argument_node.doc",
    "value": "The witness attached to a strictly dense subset: a family of VC dimension 1 on a ground set of size exactly κ whose traces are at least as many as the points of J."
  },
  {
    "field": "argument_node.pretty",
    "value": "∀ {κ : Cardinal.{u}} {J : Type u} [inst : LinearOrder J] {E : Set J},\n  Cardinal.aleph0 ≤ κ →\n    Cardinal.mk ↑E ≤ κ →\n      IsStrictlyDenseIn E →\n        ∃ α 𝒜 A, Cardinal.mk ↑A = κ ∧ HasVCDimLE 1 𝒜 ∧ Cardinal.mk J ≤ Cardinal.mk ↑((fun x => A ∩ x) '' 𝒜)"
  },
