    "value": "The two readings of \"dense subset\" define the same cardinal function at every infinite cardinal. Every bracketing witness is turned into a strict witness of at least its size by mk_le_ded'_of_isDenseIn, at the cost of a countable factor in the dense subset, which an infinite κ absorbs."
  },
